{"id":"celebracio_n","lemma":"celebración","pos":"noun","rank":3036,"glosses":["celebration"],"ipa":"/θelebɾaˈθjon/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"celebraciones"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/aa/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-celebraci%C3%B3n.wav","examples":[{"text":"Aún continúa la celebración.","en":"The celebration's still going on.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/722642","words":[{"g":"still, yet"},{"g":"to continue","l":"continuar"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"Los padres serán invitados para la celebración escolar.","en":"Parents will be invited to the school celebration.","words":[{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"father, parent","l":"padre"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"invited","l":"invitado"},{"g":"for"},{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"to go through a narrow…"}]},{"text":"Tom estaba en la celebración y me trajo a casa.","en":"Tom was at the party and he drove me home.","words":[null,{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"and"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"to bring","l":"traer"},null,null],"phrases":[[8,10,"home"]]},{"text":"La celebración de la Navidad no será igual este año sin Tom.","en":"The Christmas party won't be the same this year without Tom.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/299691","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,null,null,{"g":"Christmas present"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"in the same way"},{"g":"this"},{"g":"year"},{"g":"without"},null],"phrases":[[2,4,"of the"]]},{"text":"Cuando se terminó la celebración de Navidad, todos salimos a cantar villancicos.","en":"After the Christmas party was over, we all went out caroling.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/299699","words":[{"g":"when"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to finish","l":"terminar"},{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"Christmas present"},{"g":"all","l":"todo"},{"g":"to go out","l":"salir"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"to sing"},{"g":"villancico","l":"villancico"}]}]}